# jtt init: see docs/commands/init.md.
Output docs/commands/gifs/init.gif
Set Height 1000
Set Width 1280
Source docs/tapes/_setup.tape

Hide
Type "jtt config remove DEMO; jtt config remove OPS; jtt config remove WEB; clear" Enter
Sleep 2s
Show
Type "jtt init" Sleep 500ms Enter Sleep 3000ms
Type "s" Sleep 400ms Enter Sleep 2000ms
Type "1" Sleep 400ms Enter Sleep 1000ms
Enter Sleep 2500ms
Type "1" Sleep 400ms Enter Sleep 1000ms
Type "days" Sleep 400ms Enter Sleep 2500ms
Type "q" Sleep 400ms Enter Sleep 3500ms
